Today is my first day on the job.

577
00:35:59,846 --> 00:36:03,346
Forget yesterday's timid self. Today, I'm reborn as a new person.

578
00:36:03,816 --> 00:36:06,816
Hang in there, Kang Tae Soon. Let's go. Let's go.

579
