588
00:36:30,306 --> 00:36:31,376
Got it?

589
00:36:31,836 --> 00:36:33,046
Do your best.

590
00:36:33,446 --> 00:36:36,576
- Do your best. - Do your best.

591
00:36:36,946 --> 00:36:38,376
- Do your best. - Do your best.

592
00:36:38,646 --> 00:36:40,316
- Do your best. - Over here. Here.

593
00:36:40,386 --> 00:36:41,816
- Do your best. - Do your best.

594
00:36:42,116 --> 00:36:43,886
- Do your best. - Over here. Here.

595
00:36:52,896 --> 00:36:54,096
Man, seriously, Tae Gu.

596
00:36:59,036 --> 00:37:01,936
- Do it for real. - Do it for real.

597
00:37:02,266 --> 00:37:05,506
- Do it for real. - Do it for real.

598
00:37:05,876 --> 00:37:06,876
Do it for...

599
