606
00:37:26,666 --> 00:37:28,926
Really?

607
00:37:29,696 --> 00:37:30,796
Just kidding.

608
00:37:32,066 --> 00:37:33,966
That wasn't funny. Wasn't funny, right?

609
00:37:34,036 --> 00:37:35,036
Yes, not funny at all.

610
00:37:35,106 --> 00:37:36,636
Since it wasn't funny, why don't we all...

611
00:37:36,706 --> 00:37:38,376
