644
00:38:48,546 --> 00:38:51,846
Hey, we were just worried about you. You didn't have to snap like that.

645
00:38:53,846 --> 00:38:55,246
You might not realize it,

646
00:38:55,916 --> 00:38:57,556
but I'm actually very calculating.

647
00:38:57,886 --> 00:39:00,056
The most carefully vetted decision in my life...

648
00:39:00,056 --> 00:39:01,526
was choosing my boyfriend.

649
00:39:02,586 --> 00:39:03,596
Though...

650
00:39:03,826 --> 00:39:05,526
I guess my standards for choosing friends...

651
00:39:05,526 --> 00:39:06,526
