658
00:39:40,326 --> 00:39:42,996
- You know how shallow they can be. - I'm heading out first.

659
00:39:43,996 --> 00:39:45,066
See you tomorrow.

660
00:39:45,936 --> 00:39:47,766
- Want a ride? - I'm good.

661
00:39:49,376 --> 00:39:51,106
(Nam My First)

662
