666
00:40:07,686 --> 00:40:08,786
- Mosquitoes are out... - Are you done?

667
00:40:08,856 --> 00:40:09,856
Where should I put this?

668
00:40:09,926 --> 00:40:11,456
Man, how long has it been since we had meat? Ouch, darn it.

669
00:40:11,456 --> 00:40:12,926
Get up and help, you slacker.

670
00:40:13,196 --> 00:40:14,196
I finished my part. Let me rest.

671
00:40:14,266 --> 00:40:15,426
- Put it here. - My back hurts.

672
00:40:15,496 --> 00:40:16,496
Hello.

673
00:40:17,336 --> 00:40:19,466
- You're here? - Hi. Cheers.

674
00:40:19,536 --> 00:40:21,166
- Cheers. - Good to meet you.

675
00:40:21,236 --> 00:40:22,636
Nice to meet you.

676
00:40:23,476 --> 00:40:25,436
I'm really glad to meet you, Na Yeon.

677
00:40:25,436 --> 00:40:27,906
Honestly, whenever Nam Il talked about you,

678
00:40:27,976 --> 00:40:30,746
I actually thought to myself, "Is this guy delusional?"

679
00:40:30,976 --> 00:40:33,386
You really do exist. It's great to meet you.

680
00:40:33,446 --> 00:40:35,616
- Nice to meet you. - I'm used to it.

681
00:40:36,416 --> 00:40:38,386
I've heard so much about both of you, too.

682
00:40:38,916 --> 00:40:40,086
Especially you, Eun Young.

683
00:40:40,486 --> 00:40:43,656
Nam Il bragged so much about finally having a fan...

684
00:40:44,226 --> 00:40:45,896
that I was almost jealous.

685
00:40:46,796 --> 00:40:49,396
- How was the show? - It was so much fun.

686
00:40:49,566 --> 00:40:50,896
Especially that sketch...

687
00:40:51,336 --> 00:40:53,266
