688
00:40:53,336 --> 00:40:55,136
- the crowd loved that one. - Right?

689
00:40:55,136 --> 00:40:56,976
We wrote that one a while ago,

690
00:40:57,036 --> 00:40:59,106
tweaked it a bit, and we're getting it reviewed next week.

691
00:40:59,176 --> 00:41:01,406
- I knew it. - Eun Young, didn't you say...

692
00:41:01,476 --> 00:41:02,476
