693
00:41:02,706 --> 00:41:04,376
What did you think? Did the changes work?

694
00:41:05,276 --> 00:41:07,446
Yes, it was funny.

695
00:41:09,656 --> 00:41:10,916
She likes everything we do,

696
00:41:10,986 --> 00:41:12,186
