697
00:41:12,256 --> 00:41:13,756
Except for just one thing.

698
00:41:16,596 --> 00:41:18,826
The ending felt kind of anticlimactic.

699
00:41:18,956 --> 00:41:21,996
Having the worker just run away at the end...

700
00:41:22,226 --> 00:41:23,336
