701
00:41:24,796 --> 00:41:26,166
She might have a point.

702
00:41:26,236 --> 00:41:29,106
- That could work. - Comedy has a structure, you know.

703
00:41:29,536 --> 00:41:30,906
That sketch has a circular narrative...

704
00:41:30,976 --> 00:41:31,976
I know.

705
00:41:32,036 --> 00:41:35,606
Still, ending it with her running away isn't great.

706
00:41:36,106 --> 00:41:38,246
Running away means you lose in the end.

707
00:41:38,316 --> 00:41:40,816
Standing up to them and giving payback...

708
00:41:40,886 --> 00:41:42,716
