709
00:41:42,886 --> 00:41:43,986
Like good triumphing over evil.

710
00:41:44,056 --> 00:41:45,056
Yes, changing the ending like that...

711
00:41:45,116 --> 00:41:46,386
- That might work. - could actually be good.

712
00:41:46,456 --> 00:41:48,956
