734
00:42:30,796 --> 00:42:33,606
Because no one wants to come in second place.

735
00:42:33,936 --> 00:42:35,936
To him, comedy is always number one.

736
00:42:38,336 --> 00:42:40,746
- Thanks. - That's seriously the worst.

737
00:42:40,806 --> 00:42:44,246
Right? He's hopeless. Not in this lifetime, no way.

738
00:42:44,546 --> 00:42:46,076
