741
00:42:50,616 --> 00:42:53,026
You're surprisingly stubborn. What do you know about comedy?

742
00:42:53,026 --> 00:42:54,326
She has to be out there somewhere, right?

743
00:42:54,386 --> 00:42:55,756
- Do you know comedy? - A woman like that.

744
00:42:56,026 --> 00:42:58,896
You two, stop it and come over here. You're ruining the vibe.

745
00:43:01,466 --> 00:43:03,996
- Hurry up, Eun Young. - Stubborn, so stubborn.

746
00:43:04,066 --> 00:43:05,066
- Thank you. - Thanks.

747
00:43:05,066 --> 00:43:06,336
- No getting through to you. - Thank you.

748
00:43:06,336 --> 00:43:08,836
Can I not even speak?

749
