750
00:43:11,036 --> 00:43:13,246
- You two are the exact same. - Sit down. Let's drink.

751
00:43:13,306 --> 00:43:14,346
Cheers, everyone.

752
00:43:14,346 --> 00:43:15,746
- All right, cheers. - Cheers!

753
00:43:15,746 --> 00:43:17,016
- Eun Young, raise your glass. - Cheers.

754
00:43:17,016 --> 00:43:18,046
Cheers.

755
00:43:20,916 --> 00:43:23,456
